if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I open the door.
text She's there, like she always is.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG301"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s54
fi
goto 56
label s54
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 56
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Once she notices me, she looks in my direction.
text She slowly opens her arms.
text Her movements are so incredibly slow as of late.
text I go over to her and settle into her arms.
text ..."You're so cold..."
text I shake my head. None of that matters.
text We don't have time.
text ..."I'm sorry I can't help you with anything..."
text I shake my head.
text While I wish I could stay here in her arms forever, I can't allow myself to do that.
text So I leave her grasp.
text ..."Are you going already?"
text I nod.
text ..."I want you to be near me."
text ..."Let's always be together."
text Yeah. That's why I'm doing this.
text That's why I have to go.
text So that from now on, we'll always be able to be together.
text She looks lonesome...
text But I shake it off and go outside.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG313"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s55
fi
goto 57
label s55
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 57
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I walk up to our mountain of junk.
text Then, I gently place the scrap I picked up today on top of it.
text I've lost track of what shape it's supposed to take.
text It's no longer shaped like anything, really.
text As soon as I place the final pieces of junk on the pile, I begin to hear a rattling noise from one side as it falls apart.
text I hang my head.
text I gather junk, then place it all in a big pile again.
text That's the cycle I've been repeating.
text If...
text This scrap only takes form when you wish from your heart for it to do so...
text I'll never be able to do this on my own...
text Because, after all...
text I'm not a human.
text I look at my hands.
text My rough, rectangular fingers...
text In fact, it was wishes that put me, a junk-doll, together in the first place.
text I have a feeling that there's nowhere we can go now.
text We can't leave this place.
text 　...I want you to be near me.
text 　...Let's be together forever.
text I remember the words she just said to me.
text It's as if...
text ...she was telling me that... I didn't have to try any longer. The words hurt.
text I feel sad.
text I want to cry.
text I can't believe how powerless I am.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG314"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s56
fi
goto 58
label s56
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 58
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I look up at the sky.
text This world is making her suffer.
text All it has ever given her is heartache.
text It's always forced her to be alone...
text And just when she thought that we were together and that she could stop being lonely, it paralyzed her...
text Ah...
text I tilt my body back, as if to howl.
text I hear a disturbing sound, like pieces of rubble scraping together.
text ..."Are you... crying?"
text I hear her voice.
text *Skreeeek*
text She slowly walks toward me and hugs me from behind.
text ..."What's the matter...?"
text *Skreeeek*
text ..."Did you remember... something sad...?"
text *Skreeeek*
text ..."No..."
text ..."It's this world... that's sad..."
text *Skree* ...
text ..."Do you want to go far away?"
text ......
text ..."Do you want to go together to that place you were trying to get to?"
text ......
text ..."The two of us..."
text ..."can start walking from here..."
text ......
text ..."A place full of things to do..."
text ..."A fun place..."
text ..."Where it's always warm..."
text ..."Do you want to go there?"
text ......
text ..."You..."
text ..."want to do that, don't you?"
text ......
text I... stop crying and face forward.
text I do want to do that.
text I nod with conviction.
text ..."Then... Let's go."
text Before the snow accumulates and turns this land into a field of white.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
